---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: bwrap is not available, so no generator ran.

A generator's script and its validation fragments run inside a sandbox:
the staging root is the only writable path, the nix store is read-only,
and there is no network. safix resolves bwrap out of nixpkgs the way
it resolves a generator's runtimeInputs, so what this reports is not a
missing package but a machine that refuses to run it — an unprivileged
user namespace being disabled is what that usually is.

There is no flag that runs a generator outside the envelope.
